<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">HABAKUKI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habakuki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Haba</para>
  <para style="mt">2 SHITABU SHA</para>
  <para style="mt">1 HABAKUKI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoleru</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu ashi shana umbuyi wa Habakuki, shitabu sha Habakuki shilifanandiri na vitabu vimonga vya umbuyi, toziya shahera ulagilagi yawugenditi kwa Israeli ama Yuda gweka yakuyi, badala yakuyi shana malalamiku mawili na luwa ya Habakuki. Viraa Mlungu kankula malalamiku gakuyi. Wabetula waliholiti handa Habakuki kalikaliti shaka shimu na Yeremia na shaka sha ukolamlima wa mfalumi Yosiya na mfalumi Yehoyakimu. Shitabundiri sha Habakuki ama shitabu shimonga shoseri sha bibiliya sheni shitakula shaka Habakuki kalikaliti ndii.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwanja Habakuki kamlalamikiliti Mlungu pakawoniti mirandu ayi yitendeka muisi ya Yuda. Mlungu kankuliti kwa kutakula handa kaweriti kawatenda Wababeri wawaagamiziyi Wayuda, shakapanu Habakuki kalalamikiti handa Mlungu kaweriti kawatendera wantu wakontola kuwakomanga walii yawaweritindiri wakontola nentu, Mlungu kankuliti kwa kulonga kuwera ata awa Wababeri hawatozwi, shakapanu Habakuki kamluwa Mlungu, su kawalanguziyi lusungu, kamkwisiti Mlungu kwa mirandu mikulu yakayitenditi kumberi aku.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Malalamiku ga kwanja ga Habakuki shipandi sha 1:1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Lyakulu lya kwanja lya Mlungu shipandi sha 1:5-11.</para>
  <para style="io">Malalamiku ga pili ga Habakuki shipandi sha 1:12-2:1.</para>
  <para style="io">Lyankulu lya pili lya Mlungu shipandi sha 2:2-20.</para>
  <para style="io">Maluwa ga Habakuki kwa Mlungu shipandi sha 3.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1" />
  <para style="s">Habakuki kankulalama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1" />Awu ndo ulagilagi wa Mtuwa Mlungu wakankiti Habakuki yakaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="HAB 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hanikuliliri mpakandii na gwenga gumpikanirandiri na kuntanga? Tutenderwa madoda! Kumbiti gutulopolandiri. <verse eid="HAB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3" />Hashi guntenda moni mirandu midoda na ntabiku? Ndewi na uhalibisiya vinzyengeta na masinganu galawira. <verse eid="HAB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4" />Hangu lagiru lyahera makakala na haki itendwandiri. Wakontola wawakanka wana haki, hangu haki ipotuziwa.<verse eid="HAB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lyankulu lya Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu katakula. Guloli wantu wa isi zimonga na guwoni, hagutili na kulikangasha. Toziya mumashaka gaku gakulikala nankutenda shintu sheni mewakugambiri megwaminindiri. <verse eid="HAB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6" />Mana haniwongeleri makakala Wababeli, wantu awa wakalipa na yawatenda kalongola, weni wapita muisi yoseri irii su kulopola pahala pamonga. <verse eid="HAB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7" />Womberi ndo wantu kukalaziya na wakuliziya, wajimirandiri lagiru loseri ila wajimira lagiru lyawu weni hera.<verse eid="HAB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8" />Farasi wawu wayewuka kutuga kuliku duma, wamashonta wawu wakalipa kuliku wang'ang'a wa kuntundu yawana njala. Wakwena farasi wawu walawa kutali na wayewuka kuwakomanga wankondu wawu handa kapungu ntambu yakagulukira mawinga.<verse eid="HAB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9" />Woseri wankwiza kutenda unkesera pawawera na vyeni vyavitiliziya, wagenda kulongolu na wajojonira lopola zivuwa handa mhanga. <verse eid="HAB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10" />Wawajongera wafalumi na kuwaseka wakolamlima. Kila liboma walibeziya na walimamatira litapaka na kulilopola. <verse eid="HAB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11" />Shakapanu wagenda kulongolu handa lyega, watenda vidoda na kuwera na madoda, toziya mlungu kawatenda waweri na makakala.<verse eid="HAB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habakuki kankumlalamikira kayi Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12" />Hashi, gwenga gwa Mtuwa Mlungu ndiri, kwanjira makashu? Gwenga ndo Mlungu gwangu, mnanagala gwangu, yaguhowa ndiri, Mtuwa Mlungu guwasyagula Wababeli watutozi, gwenga litalawu lyangu, guwagangamaziya su watukomangi. <verse eid="HAB 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13" />Nakaka gwenga gwa mnanagala, hapaguwezi kulola ukontola na guwezandiri kunyamalira kuwona madoda. Iwerahashi guwawona wankutenda makontola na kunyamala? Iwerahashi vinu gulikalajii shaka wantu wadoda pawawamira wantu yawana haki kuliku womberi?<verse eid="HAB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14" />Guwatenda wantu handa wasomba mubahari na handa viwumbi vyavikwawakwawa na vyavyahera na mkolamlima? <verse eid="HAB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15" />Wababeli wawalowa wantu kwa ndowanu na wawajojonira woseri mushombu shawu, shakapanu wanemelera na kufyapilira. <verse eid="HAB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16" />Hangu wazitambikira nyavu zyawu na kuzitumizilira ubani, toziya nyavu zawu azi ziwapanana shiboga shiherepa.<verse eid="HAB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17" />Hashi hawendeleyi kulikomanga nkondu? Na hawendereyi kuwabata wantu na kuwagamiza wantu wa isi zimonga pota lusungu?<verse eid="HAB 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankumwankula Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1" />Neni hangoloki mushindwalingu, handoli moni shakafira kung'ambira na lyankulu gaa lyanandaviyi kuusu kulalama kwaneni.<verse eid="HAB 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2" />“Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kanankula hangu, gulembi galii ganfira kukulanguziya na gugatendi mwaziwu pampindi pa vibawu, su yakapita panu kapati kugasoma.” <verse eid="HAB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3" />Gulembi galii ganikulangaziyiti, toziya shaka shakuyi badu shakwiza. Kumbiti shaka shakuyi shankwiza kalongola na ganikulanguziyiti hagaweri nakaka. Na paguwona gakawalira gwenga guwuheperi, nakaka hagizi na hapeni gakawaliri. <verse eid="HAB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4" />Gwandiki, yoseri yakana mtiti hakagamiri, kumbiti yakana haki hakalikali kwa njimiru yakuyi.<verse eid="HAB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu wakontola hawagamiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5" />“Pamuhera na aga, divayi ipotiziya, muntu yakana mtiti kalikalandiri mnumba mwakuyi, kongera matamata gakuyi handa kwawahowiti, yomberi kawera handa mawuti, kawezandiri kwikutuziwa, ila kalijojonira maisi goseri, kalitulira makabila goseri vipinga vipinga.” <verse eid="HAB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6" />Kira muntu hakawajongeri wantu wa ntambu ayi na kuwimbira nyimbu za kuwashinigira. “Shondi mwenga yamulimamatira vintu vyaviwitwi na kulimamatira vintu kwa makakala. Hagwendeleyi kutenda hangu mpakandii?”<verse eid="HAB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7" />Hashi yawakushonga hapawakwiziri vumu? Hashi hapawakutendi gulendemeri? Shakapanu hawakubati guweri mlopola gwawu. <verse eid="HAB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8" />Toziya gwenga gupoka lunda za wantu wa maisi gamonga, kumbiti woseri yawaponeka hawakupoki gwenga, toziya ya malaga na madoda yagugatendiriti isi na miji na wenikaya wakuyi woseri.<verse eid="HAB 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9" />Hagushiwoni gwenga yagulimatila lunda kwa kumtenda yumonga na yagunyawa numba yaku pampindi pa migongu, pagulihola kuwera gwa ponga. <verse eid="HAB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10" />Kumbiti kwa mipangu yaku yiwagamiziya wantu wavuwa, guyisoniziya kaya yaku na gugaagamiziya makaliru gaku gamweni. <verse eid="HAB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11" />Kwa kutenda hangu ata mabuhi ga mushibambaza hagakulalamikiri na boriti hazitendi ntambuiraayi.<verse eid="HAB 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12" />Hagushiwoni gwenga yagunyawa mji kwa kulaga wantu na kwanjisha mji mkulu kwa makontola. <verse eid="HAB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13" />Ntambugaa, Mtuwa Mlungu Yakana Makakala katenda mahengu ga wantu gagamiri mumotu na maisi gamonga galishenyiyi hera? <verse eid="HAB 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14" />Kumbiti pasipanu hapamemiziwi mahala ga uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu, handa mashi ntambu yageneya mubahari.<verse eid="HAB 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15" />Hagushiwoni gwenga yaguwalowiziya wapakwegera waku na kuminta kulawa mushiliba chawatula simika mudivayi yawu su gupati kuwawona pawawera shivula. <verse eid="HAB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16" />Haguweri na soni pota hapagupananwi ligoya. Hagulandi gamweni na kukwakatika. Mtuwa Mlungu hakakulewiziyi, soni hayiyigibikili ligoya lyaku. <verse eid="HAB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17" />Makontola gaguwatendiriti wantu wa Lebanoni hagakuwuyiri gamweni na matendu gaku ga kuwalaga wankanyama hagakutiriziyi. Goseri aga hagakukankali gwenga, toziya ya malaga yagugatenditi muisi, miji na wenikaya wakuyi woseri.<verse eid="HAB 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18" />Shinyagu shakanyawiti muntu shana mana gaa, shinyagu ndo mabuhi hera yagayeyushitwi, ndo shintu sha kupalasiya upotuziya. Toziya mnyawa shinyagu kalidumbira shakanyawiti mweni, ashi ndo shinyagu shashiyowerandiri. <verse eid="HAB 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19" />Hakashiwoni muntu yakalugambira lugogu. “Gwimuki!” Ama kuligambira libuhi “Gwimuki!” Hashi shinyagu shiweza kumfunda Muntu? Guloli shinyagu shityeremeziwa zahabu na feza, kumbiti shahera ata ukomu.<verse eid="HAB 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20" />“Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu Kamunumba yakuyi nanagala na wantu woseri wanyamali jii kulongolu kwakuyi.”<verse eid="HAB 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3" />
  <para style="s">Maluwa ga Habakuki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1" />Aga ndo maluwa ga mtambika Habakuki.<verse eid="HAB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2" />Gwe Mtuwa Mlungu, Mpikanira zyuma zyaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">na matendu gaku na neni ntira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">Guyitendi kayi mirandu ayi shaka shetu, guyitendi imaniki shaka ashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:2">pagukalala tukuluwa gutuwoneri lusungu.<verse eid="HAB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3" />Mlungu kiza kulawa Temani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Mlungu Mnanagala kiza kulawa lugongu Parani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">Uweru wakuyi umema poseri kumpindi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:3">na wantu woseri wamzyumi yomberi.<verse eid="HAB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4" />Ung'eleng'eta wakuyi handa wa mshenji yagulawa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">miyali imulikiti kulawa mumawoku mwakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:4">peni makakala gakuyi gafifitwi.<verse eid="HAB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5" />Kagalagaliriti malweri kulongolu kwakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:5">na kuhowa kwiza kumberi kwakuyi.<verse eid="HAB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6" />Pakagoloka isi itikinyika;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">kaloliti na kutenda wantu walendemeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">Migongu migona imegwamegwa na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">vigongu vyavimanika viguwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:6">njira zakuyi ndo zamashaka goseri.<verse eid="HAB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7" />Niwawoniti wantu wa Kushani wamuntabiku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:7">na wantu wa Midiani pawalendemera<verse eid="HAB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, hashi guyikalaliriti mishemba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">Hashi gugakalaliriti mashi ga bahali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">shaka pagwendeshiti farasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:8">na mbutuka zyaku kugenda kukanka?<verse eid="HAB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9" />Guwutuliti kala upindi waku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">kala kwa kuguma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:9">na kuyipanta isi kwa nshemba.<verse eid="HAB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10" />Migongu ikuwoniti ilendemera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">mashi yagalawiti kumpindi gapita amu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">Matiwa ga bahari galaviyiti liziwu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:10">na kugulusiya makupala gakuyi.<verse eid="HAB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11" />Kumpindi mshenji na lyezi vinyamaliti jii</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">paviwoniti langala ya misali yaku payigenda kalongola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:11">yina muwung'eleng'etu wa mgoha gwaku.<verse eid="HAB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12" />Kwa maya gupititi paisi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:12">guwatimbangiti wantu wa isi zoseri kwa maya gaku.<verse eid="HAB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13" />Gwiziti kuwalopola wantu waku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">kumlopola ulii yagumsyaguti kwa kumswaga lipaki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">Gumlemiti mlonguziya gwa isi ya ukontola</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:13">na guwaagamiziya nakamu yawamfata.<verse eid="HAB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14" />Gumsomiti kwa misali mlonguziya gwa lishonta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">shaka lishonta paliziti gambira lipuga kutupalasiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:14">pawalitumba kwa kuwalaga wantu wahushu mwawalififiti.<verse eid="HAB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15" />Gutimbiti bahali kwa farasi waku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:15">makupala yagagolokandiri.<verse eid="HAB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16" />Pampikaniriti aga moyu gwangu guweriti na lyoga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">milomu yangu itetemekiti kwa lyoga, pampikaniriti liziwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">nanja kulwala mumihonju yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">na magulu gangu gasinditi kugendagenda.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HAB 3:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">Hangu hahepeleri lishaka lirii lya ntambiku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:16">lyaliwizira walii yawatukomanga.<verse eid="HAB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17" />Payiwera tini ilaviyandiri uluwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ama mizabibu kulerandiri zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">na mizeytuni payilerandiri zeituni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">na malambu pagalaviyandiri shiboga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ata kondolu woseri pawafuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:17">ama mifugu meyifuwi mulizizi,<verse eid="HAB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18" />neni hanendeleyi kumfyapilira Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:18">hanimnemeleri Mlungu mlopola gwangu.<verse eid="HAB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo makakala gangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">Kagagangamaziya magulu gangu gambira ga mbawala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HAB 3:19">kantenda weri poneka pampindi pa migongu.<verse eid="HAB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3" />
</usx>